         <link>https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/toronto/dangerous-driving-sentencing-cristillo-kirubananthan-9.7435165?cmp=rss</link>
         <description><![CDATA[<img src='https://i.cbc.ca/ais/530bc4de-9c69-4cb2-b33b-bf2ab68804eb,1777315508788/full/max/0/default.jpg?im=Crop%2Crect%3D%2813%2C0%2C3557%2C2000%29%3B' alt='A court sketch.' width='620' height='349' title='L to r: Defence lawyer Barry Fox Crown attorney Sean Doyle Justice Ann Marina Elias Jaiwin Kirubananthan in prisoner’s box Newmarket April 27/26'/><p>A driver in a head-on crash that killed a father of three last year and prompted the Ontario government to introduce tougher dangerous driving penalties has been sentenced to six years and six months behind bars.</p>]]></description>
